@startuml AUTH_SEQUENCE
title Auth (cible) — Session cookie HttpOnly

actor User as U
participant "Client (Next.js)" as C
participant "Firebase Auth (client)" as FA
participant "API Next (server)" as API
participant "Firebase Admin" as ADM

U -> C: Saisit identifiants
C -> FA: signInWithEmailAndPassword()
FA --> C: user + idToken

C -> API: POST /api/auth/session (idToken)
API -> ADM: verifyIdToken(idToken)
ADM --> API: decoded claims
API -> ADM: createSessionCookie(idToken, ttl)
ADM --> API: sessionCookie
API --> C: Set-Cookie: __session (HttpOnly)

U -> C: Navigue vers /dashboard
C -> API: Request /dashboard (cookie __session)
API -> ADM: verifySessionCookie(__session)
ADM --> API: decoded claims
API --> C: Autorisé

U -> C: Logout
C -> API: POST /api/auth/logout
API --> C: Clear-Cookie: __session
C -> FA: signOut()

@enduml

